; FamicomControllerII -- player 2's pad, with the microphone and its volume slider where Controller I has START and SELECT.
;
; 118 x 54 x 22 mm, held across the hands with the cord leaving the far edge
; (-Z). It sits in one of the console's side wells turned lengthways, which is
; what a 53 mm well is for.
;
; Colours are read off photographs: a dark red shell, a gold face plate, a black
; cross and red buttons. No dimensioned drawing or paint reference was found.
[sub_resource type="PhysicsMaterial" id="PhysMat_fc"]
friction = 0.8

