; Travel along the pad's +X, so the far LEFT of the track is off -- which is
; where the real slider silences the microphone. It starts open, because a pad
; that arrived silent would read as broken rather than as turned down.
[node name="VolumeSlider" type="Area3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, -0.017, 0.0145, 0.013)
